Changes: the data is transformed into dashboard and deduction artifacts by
scripts/closure.py, scripts/graph.py, scripts/build_project_page.py, and
scripts/build_review.py. The underlying mathematical facts are unmodified; only
their representation changes.

The π-Base software (the deduction engine this project's closure.py re-implements)
is separately available at https://github.com/pi-base/web under the MIT License.

This product includes the implications engine payload from Felix Pernegger's
pi-base data fork, vendored at data/implications.json and refreshed at deploy
time by scripts/fetch_implications.py.

